# Reactions, richer (Docs/Design/62-talk.md, phase 7): a fight seen, a blow taken, a theft seen, the rain coming on, a
# customer at the door (and the keeper going on, shop.pitch), and two friends passing (react.friend, then greet.answer,
# friend.where, friend.tease, friend.invite, friend.news, friend.close, friend.parting). Broad pools first, so anyone
# has plenty to say; then the specific, by job, stage, traits, wealth, place, hour and the day.
#
# Marks for passing talk: an opener that asks about something sets pair.mem.fq (what was asked), and an answer that
# expects a reply sets pair.mem.fx (how it went), both for 30 minutes, so the next beat answers what was actually said.

## ---------------------------------------------------------------- A fight, seen

rule x7_fight_any
when concept=react.fight
say Oi! Pack it in! | Somebody fetch the Watch, quick! | Not here, not in the street! | Look at them go. Daft beggars. | Mind yourselves, there's pups about!

rule x7_fight_any2
when concept=react.fight
say Gods, there's blood on the cobbles. | Somebody'll lose an ear before this is done. | Leave off! Leave off, the pair of you! | Who started it? Did anyone see who started it?

rule x7_fight_any3
when concept=react.fight
say Over what, though? Over what? | Step back, give them room, before someone's knocked flat. | That's the Watch's business, not mine. | Ooh. That one felt it.

rule x7_fight_watch
when concept=react.fight self.role=guard self.on_watch=yes
cooldown 10m
say Watch! Lay down your arms! | You two! Apart, now, or it's the cells! | Paws where I can see them! Both of you! | Enough! Next one to swing spends the night in irons.

rule x7_fight_guard_off
when concept=react.fight self.role=guard self.on_watch=no
cooldown 30m
say I'm off duty. I'm off duty. Oh, for... OI! | Can't a wolf have one hour's peace? Break it up! | Right. Somebody hold my cup.

rule x7_fight_guard_night
when concept=react.fight self.role=guard here.time=night
cooldown 30m
say Every night. Every blessed night. | Lanterns! Bring a lantern, I can't see who's who! | That's it, the both of you, sleep it off in the cells.

rule x7_fight_soldier
when concept=react.fight self.job=soldier
cooldown 20m
say Feet planted, you fool, you'll go over. | Terrible guard. Who taught you, a scarecrow? | Keep your elbow in! Elbow! | Sloppy. Very sloppy. I'd have put them both down by now.

rule x7_fight_tavern_keeper
when concept=react.fight self.job=innkeeper here.place=tavern
cooldown 20m
say Not in my house! Out, the both of you! | That stool was my father's! | Take it outside or I'll take it out of your hides! | That's my good table!

rule x7_fight_tavern
when concept=react.fight here.place=tavern
cooldown 20m
say Mind the drinks! Mind the drinks! | Not by the fire, you fools! | Ha! Didn't spill a drop, look. | Duck!

rule x7_fight_healer
when concept=react.fight self.job=healer
cooldown 20m
say Don't kill each other, I've only so much linen. | One of you'll be on my table by supper. | Somebody bring me water and clean rags. I'll be needed.

rule x7_fight_priest
when concept=react.fight self.job=priest
cooldown 20m
say Peace! Peace, in the Bright One's name! | Put it down, children. Put it down. | Is this how wolves behave? Is it? | The Bright One sees you. Both of you.

rule x7_fight_chapel
when concept=react.fight here.place=chapel
priority 1
cooldown 20m
say In a chapel! In a chapel! | Not here! Not before the Bright One! | Have you no shame at all?

rule x7_fight_market_stall
when concept=react.fight self.role=merchant here.place=market
cooldown 20m
say Off my table! Off it! | Mind the eggs! Mind the... oh, the eggs. | If that table goes over, you're buying everything on it. | Take it elsewhere, you're scaring off my custom!

rule x7_fight_merchant
when concept=react.fight self.role=merchant
cooldown 30m
say Bad for trade, that is. | Shutters! Somebody help me with the shutters! | Not on my step. Anywhere but my step.

rule x7_fight_young
when concept=react.fight self.stage=young
cooldown 15m
say Fight! Fight! Fight! | Hit 'im! Go on! | #mum#! #mum#! Come and look! | I could take them both. Easy. | Whoa! Right on the snout!

rule x7_fight_adolescent
when concept=react.fight self.stage=adolescent
cooldown 15m
say Penny on the big one. | Ooh, that's gone in the ribs. | My money's on the one with the torn ear. Who's in? | Ha! Down like a sack of meal!

rule x7_fight_old
when concept=react.fight self.stage=old
cooldown 20m
say They'll both be sorry in the morning. | Not a scrap of skill between them. | Disgraceful. Somebody tell their mothers. | I've seen better fights between hens.

rule x7_fight_nervy
when concept=react.fight self.temper=nervy
cooldown 20m
say Oh gods, oh gods. Someone stop them. | I'm not watching. I'm not watching. | Should we run? Should we run? | Somebody do something!

rule x7_fight_short
when concept=react.fight self.temper=short
cooldown 20m
say Right, that's it, I'll knock their heads together myself. | Break it up before I join in! | Some of us are trying to get by here!

rule x7_fight_calm
when concept=react.fight self.temper=calm
cooldown 20m
say Let them tire. They will. | Stand back. It'll be over in a moment. | Hm. That one's no fighter. | No sense getting in the middle of it.

rule x7_fight_merry
when concept=react.fight self.humour=merry
cooldown 20m
say Ha! He's dancing better than he's fighting! | Ten pennies on the one with the ears! | Do it again, I missed that! | Lovely. Better than the mummers at the festival.

rule x7_fight_dry
when concept=react.fight self.humour=dry
cooldown 30m
say Ah. The town council's sitting, I see. | I see the debate has reached its natural end. | Lovely weather for it.

rule x7_fight_devout
when concept=react.fight self.piety=devout
cooldown 30m
say Bright One, put peace in their paws. | They'll answer for this on Restday. | I'll pray for them. When I've finished being angry.

rule x7_fight_sly
when concept=react.fight self.honesty=sly
cooldown 30m
say While everyone's looking... no. No. | That purse on the ground isn't anybody's, is it? | Keep it going, lads. Keep it going.

rule x7_fight_warm
when concept=react.fight self.warmth=warm
cooldown 30m
say Somebody help the one who's down! | Oh, stop, stop, he's hurt! | Enough! You'll kill each other!

rule x7_fight_quiet
when concept=react.fight self.talk=quiet
cooldown 30m
say Mm. Trouble. | Oh dear. | Not my business.

rule x7_fight_rich
when concept=react.fight self.wealth=rich
cooldown 30m
say How vulgar. | Is there no Watch in this town? What do we pay for? | Somebody remove them from my path. | Brawling in the street like dockhands.

rule x7_fight_heights
when concept=react.fight self.quarter=heights here.region=ridgemere
cooldown 30m
say Like the Sump. Exactly like the Sump. | Brawling in daylight, in Ridgemere. What is the Council for? | I shall be writing to the captain of the Watch.

rule x7_fight_poor
when concept=react.fight self.wealth=poor|destitute
cooldown 30m
say Not again. Every week, now. | Keep your head down and your purse closer. | Somebody'll be robbing the loser before long.

rule x7_fight_sump
when concept=react.fight self.quarter=sump here.region=ridgemere
cooldown 30m
say Sump's waking up, then. | Nobody's calling the Watch, are they? No. Didn't think so. | Mind your back. They'll be on the rest of us next.

rule x7_fight_beggar
when concept=react.fight self.job=beggar
cooldown 30m
say Spare a coin for the show? | Bet one of them drops a penny or two. | I'll keep out of it, thanks. I've nothing left to lose but teeth.

rule x7_fight_sailor
when concept=react.fight self.job=sailor
cooldown 30m
say Ha! Call that a brawl? Should see a ship's crew on pay day. | Swing low, mate! Low! | Pair of landlubbers. All elbows.

rule x7_fight_shore
when concept=react.fight here.place=shore
cooldown 30m
say Somebody's going in the water! | Not by the boats! Not by the nets! | Throw 'em both in, cool 'em off.

rule x7_fight_carter
when concept=react.fight self.job=carter
cooldown 30m
say Out of the road! You'll spook the mule! | Not in front of the cart! | Mind the wheel, you'll lose a paw!

rule x7_fight_smith
when concept=react.fight self.job=smith|miner|laborer
cooldown 30m
say Want me to settle it? I've arms for it. | Shall I fetch the big hammer? | One more swing and I'm stepping in.

rule x7_fight_farm
when concept=react.fight self.job=farmer|herder here.place=field
cooldown 30m
say Daft as rams in spring. | Not in the crop! Not in the crop! | You'll scatter the flock, you fools!

rule x7_fight_night
when concept=react.fight here.time=night
cooldown 30m
say Gods, at this hour? | Fighting in the dark like rats. | Someone'll end up in a ditch before morning. | Keep it down! People are sleeping!

rule x7_fight_festival
when concept=react.fight here.day=festival here.festival
cooldown 30m
say Every festival, someone. Every single one. | Too much cider, that's what that is. | Not today! It's #here.festival#!

rule x7_fight_market_day
when concept=react.fight here.day=market here.crowd=busy|crowd
cooldown 30m
say Mind the stalls! | Somebody'll lose more than a tooth in this crush. | Make room! Make room or they'll have us all over!

rule x7_fight_parent
when concept=react.fight self.parent=yes self.stage!=young
cooldown 30m
say Pups, inside! Now! | Don't look, #child#. Come away. | And there's pups watching! Shame on you!

rule x7_fight_fought
when concept=react.fight self.fought=yes
cooldown 1h
say Not again. I've had my fill of fists this week. | My ribs ache just watching. | Seen enough of that for a lifetime.

rule x7_fight_hurt
when concept=react.fight self.injured=light|bad
cooldown 1h
say I can't help. I'm hurt myself. | Don't come this way, I'm in no state. | Somebody else. I've had mine.

rule x7_fight_ridgemere
when concept=react.fight here.region=ridgemere
cooldown 1h
say City wolves. No sense. | That's the third fight on this street since Restday. | And the Watch is never here when you want them.

rule x7_fight_town
when concept=react.fight here.region=frosthollow|coldwater|oakhaven|mirebridge|larkfield|southmeadow
cooldown 1h
say Here? In #here.town#? | Everybody'll know about this by supper. | Their mothers will hear of it. Everyone's mothers will.

## ---------------------------------------------------------------- Struck

rule x7_struck_any
when concept=react.struck
say Ow! | You'll regret that! | That's it. That is it! | Hah! Missed the important bits. | Right. Right!

rule x7_struck_any2
when concept=react.struck
say My ear! My good ear! | Is that the best you've got? | Come on, then! | You #lump#!

rule x7_struck_any3
when concept=react.struck
say Hey! I felt that! | Not the face! | Ugh. Again? | Stop! Stop it!

rule x7_struck_young
when concept=react.struck self.stage=young
priority 1
say Ow! I'm telling! | That's not fair! | #mum#! | I didn't do nothing!

rule x7_struck_adolescent
when concept=react.struck self.stage=adolescent
say Didn't hurt! Didn't hurt! | You're dead, you are! | You hit like a lamb!

rule x7_struck_old
when concept=react.struck self.stage=old
priority 1
say I'm too old for this! | My hip! You've done my hip! | Hit an old wolf, would you? | When I was your age I'd have had you!

rule x7_struck_guard
when concept=react.struck self.role=guard
say Striking the Watch! That's the cells for you! | That's another charge against your name. | Assault on the Watch. Remember I said it.

rule x7_struck_soldier
when concept=react.struck self.job=soldier
say Good. Now mine. | Felt that. Barely. | That's how you want it? Fine.

rule x7_struck_nervy
when concept=react.struck self.temper=nervy
say Stop! Please stop! | Help! Somebody! | I didn't do anything!

rule x7_struck_short
when concept=react.struck self.temper=short
say Right, you've asked for it! | I'll have your ears for that! | Come here! Come here!

rule x7_struck_calm
when concept=react.struck self.temper=calm
say Hm. Fine. | Steady. Steady. | That's one.

rule x7_struck_merry
when concept=react.struck self.humour=merry
say Ha! Tickles! | You hit like my gran. | Ooh, that'll be a bruise worth showing off.

rule x7_struck_dry
when concept=react.struck self.humour=dry
say Ah. Yes. That's how that feels. | Lovely. Thank you. | I'll put that on your account.

rule x7_struck_devout
when concept=react.struck self.piety=devout
say Bright One, give me strength. | Bright One, hold my temper. Hold it tight. | Strike me again and we'll both be praying.

rule x7_struck_rich
when concept=react.struck self.wealth=rich
say Do you know who I am? | My coat! This is Mossgrave wool! | You'll answer for that, you guttersnipe!

rule x7_struck_house
when concept=react.struck self.house
say My House will hear of this! | You'd strike a House's own? You'll learn. | Mark my coat. You'll be seeing it again, with friends.

rule x7_struck_greatly
when concept=react.struck self.house=greatly_house
say Lord Greatly will hear of this, and half the harbour with him! | You've struck Greatly House. Enjoy the gaol. | Greatly's people don't forget. Ask anyone on the wharf.

rule x7_struck_fell
when concept=react.struck self.house=house_fell
say Lady Fell will hear of this! | Strike Fell's own? You'll be splitting logs in the Rainwood till you're grey. | Fell remembers. Fell always remembers.

rule x7_struck_grayrock
when concept=react.struck self.house=grayrock_hall
say Lord Aldric's on the road, but Lady Maren isn't. She'll hear of this! | Grayrock's own, and you strike them? | You'll be breaking stone for Grayrock by the month's end.

rule x7_struck_mossgrave
when concept=react.struck self.house=mossgrave_court
say Lord Halvard will have your hide for a fleece! | Mossgrave's own, struck in the street! | You'll answer to Mossgrave Court for that.

rule x7_struck_light
when concept=react.struck self.injured=light
priority 1
say Not the same paw! Not the same paw! | That's on top of the last one! | Ow. That's twice now.

rule x7_struck_bad_old
when concept=react.struck self.injured=bad self.stage=old
priority 3
say No more. No more, please. | I'm an old wolf... leave me be. | Fetch my... fetch someone.

rule x7_struck_bad_young
when concept=react.struck self.injured=bad self.stage=young
priority 3
say #mum#... | It hurts, it hurts! | I want to go home.

rule x7_struck_bad
when concept=react.struck self.injured=bad
priority 2
say I yield! I yield! | Enough... I'm done. | Somebody stop them...

rule x7_struck_fought
when concept=react.struck self.fought=yes
say Twice in two days! What is it with me? | Not again! | I've not healed from the last one!

rule x7_struck_strong
when concept=react.struck self.job=smith|miner|laborer|woodcutter
say I lift more than you for a living, pup. | Paws like mine, and you want to fight? | That's a mistake, friend.

rule x7_struck_sailor
when concept=react.struck self.job=sailor|fisher
say Blood and brine! | Right, you've earned a dunking. | I've been hit harder by a wave.

rule x7_struck_tavern
when concept=react.struck self.job=innkeeper here.place=tavern
say In my own house! | You're barred! Barred! | That's the last drink you'll have under my roof!

## ---------------------------------------------------------------- A theft, seen

rule x7_theft_any
when concept=react.theft
say Thief! Stop that wolf! | Hey! Hey! Drop it! | Did you see that? Bold as brass! | Somebody grab them!

rule x7_theft_any2
when concept=react.theft
say Watch your purses, everyone! | Gone, just like that. | Right in front of us! | That's not theirs! That's not theirs!

rule x7_theft_any3
when concept=react.theft
say Watch! Where's the Watch? | Which way did they go? | After them, someone! | Quick paws on that one.

rule x7_theft_watch
when concept=react.theft self.role=guard self.on_watch=yes
cooldown 10m
say Halt! Stop, thief! | After them! Cut them off at the corner! | You! Stop in the name of the Watch! | I saw your face! I'll know it again!

rule x7_theft_guard_off
when concept=react.theft self.role=guard self.on_watch=no
cooldown 30m
say Off duty, and now this. Stop! | Right in front of a guard. The cheek of it. | I'll remember you. I never forget a tail.

rule x7_theft_merchant
when concept=react.theft self.role=merchant
cooldown 20m
say Everyone, mind your stalls! Mind your tables! | Not again! Not again this month! | Who's watching my table? Somebody!

rule x7_theft_failing
when concept=react.theft self.role=merchant self.business=failing
priority 1
cooldown 30m
say I can't afford that, not now! | That's my week gone. My whole week. | Of all the weeks to be robbed.

rule x7_theft_young
when concept=react.theft self.stage=young
cooldown 15m
say Thief! I saw! I saw the thief! | Ooh, they're fast! | I'll catch 'em! | #mum#, a robber!

rule x7_theft_adolescent
when concept=react.theft self.stage=adolescent
cooldown 15m
say Ha! Nice paws. | Bet they get away. | Should I chase them? I'm fast.

rule x7_theft_old
when concept=react.theft self.stage=old
cooldown 20m
say In my day they'd have had a paw off for that. | Nothing's safe any more. Nothing. | In my day the Watch walked the streets, not the taverns.

rule x7_theft_nervy
when concept=react.theft self.temper=nervy
cooldown 20m
say Is my purse... oh, thank the gods. | I'm going home. I'm going straight home. | They could be anywhere. Anyone!

rule x7_theft_short
when concept=react.theft self.temper=short
cooldown 20m
say I'll have them! Come back here! | Let me get my paws on them! | Thieving little rat!

rule x7_theft_calm
when concept=react.theft self.temper=calm
cooldown 20m
say Mark the coat. Brown, patched at the elbow. | They'll not get far. | Tell the Watch what you saw. Exactly what you saw.

rule x7_theft_devout
when concept=react.theft self.piety=devout
cooldown 30m
say Bright One, turn their heart. | The Bright One sees what's taken. Every crumb of it. | They'll answer for it, if not here then after.

rule x7_theft_restday
when concept=react.theft here.day=rest
cooldown 30m
say On Restday! Have they no shame? | Stealing on the Bright One's day. | Chapel bell's barely stopped!

rule x7_theft_rich
when concept=react.theft self.wealth=rich
cooldown 30m
say Robbed in broad day! What is this town coming to? | I shall write to the council. | Somebody find a guard. A competent one.

rule x7_theft_poor
when concept=react.theft self.wealth=poor|destitute
cooldown 30m
say Can't blame them, at the price of bread. | Hope it was worth it, friend. | Didn't see a thing. Not a thing.

rule x7_theft_sly
when concept=react.theft self.honesty=sly
cooldown 30m
say Clean work, that. Very clean. | Not bad. Not bad at all. | Amateur. You go round, not through.

rule x7_theft_frank
when concept=react.theft self.honesty=frank
cooldown 30m
say I saw you! I saw your face! | That one! There! The one running! | Thief! I'll swear to it before anyone!

rule x7_theft_robbed
when concept=react.theft self.robbed=yes
priority 1
cooldown 30m
say Same as me! That's how they got me too! | Another one! There's a gang of them! | Was it them? Was it the same one?

rule x7_theft_beggar
when concept=react.theft self.job=beggar
cooldown 30m
say Weren't me! I was here the whole time! | Now they'll blame us lot. | Ha. Some have all the luck.

rule x7_theft_night
when concept=react.theft here.time=night|dusk
cooldown 30m
say In the dark, of course. | Lock your doors tonight. | Can't see a thing. Which way?

rule x7_theft_market
when concept=react.theft here.day=market
cooldown 30m
say Market day. Cutpurses' holiday. | Keep your purses inside your coats! | Every market day, regular as bells.

rule x7_theft_tavern
when concept=react.theft here.place=tavern
cooldown 30m
say Somebody's lifted a purse! Nobody leaves! | Bar the door! | Check your coats, all of you.

rule x7_theft_merry
when concept=react.theft self.humour=merry
cooldown 30m
say Ha! Off like a hare! | Look at that one go! | Somebody give them a prize for speed.

rule x7_theft_dry
when concept=react.theft self.humour=dry
cooldown 30m
say Well. Someone's having a good day. | Prices are down, I see. All the way to nothing. | That's one way to do your shopping.

rule x7_theft_warm
when concept=react.theft self.warmth=warm
cooldown 30m
say Are you all right? Did they hurt you? | Oh, the poor thing. Was it much? | Sit down, sit down. I'll fetch someone.

rule x7_theft_parent
when concept=react.theft self.parent=yes self.stage!=young
cooldown 30m
say Hold my paw, #child#. Tight. | Stay close to me. | See? That's why we don't wander off.

rule x7_theft_sump
when concept=react.theft self.quarter=sump|docks|wharf here.region=ridgemere
cooldown 1h
say Welcome to the waterfront. | Nobody saw nothing. That's the rule down here. | They'll have sold it twice before the Watch hears.

rule x7_theft_town
when concept=react.theft here.region=frosthollow|coldwater|oakhaven|mirebridge|larkfield|southmeadow
cooldown 1h
say Not in #here.town#! We don't do that here! | That's no local, mark me. | Everybody'll hear of this by dark.

## ---------------------------------------------------------------- Rain coming on

rule x7_rain_any
when concept=react.rain
say And there's the sky opened. | That's the end of the dry. | Oh, lovely. Lovely. | Under the eaves, quick!

rule x7_rain_any2
when concept=react.rain
say Here we go. | Smelled it coming. | Well, that's me soaked. | Somebody's washing'll be ruined.

rule x7_rain_any3
when concept=react.rain
say Run for it! | Ugh. Down my collar. | Felt a drop. Two. Oh, here it comes.

rule x7_rain_young
when concept=react.rain self.stage=young
say Rain! Puddles! | Catch it on your tongue! | #mum#'ll skin me, these are my good boots. | I'm a fish! Look, I'm a fish!

rule x7_rain_adolescent
when concept=react.rain self.stage=adolescent
say Ugh. My fur. | Race you to the arch! | Great. Just great.

rule x7_rain_old
when concept=react.rain self.stage=old
say Told you. My knee told me this morning. | Inside, before it gets in my bones. | Rain, rain. More rain. Always rain.

rule x7_rain_market
when concept=react.rain self.role=merchant here.place=market
cooldown 2h
say Cover the goods! Cover the goods! | Oilcloth, quick! | That's my custom gone home.

rule x7_rain_merchant_failing
when concept=react.rain self.role=merchant self.business=failing
priority 1
cooldown 2h
say That's the day done, then. | Course it's raining. Course it is. | Nobody'll come out in this.

rule x7_rain_fisher
when concept=react.rain self.job=fisher|sailor
cooldown 2h
say Rain's fine. It's wind I mind. | Call this rain? You should see the Sound in winter. | Wet's wet. I'm wet already.

rule x7_rain_farmer_grow
when concept=react.rain self.job=farmer here.season=spring|summer
cooldown 2h
say Good for the barley. | About time. The ground was cracking. | Drink it up, my lovelies.

rule x7_rain_farmer_harvest
when concept=react.rain self.job=farmer here.season=autumn
priority 1
cooldown 2h
say Not now, the harvest's half in! | Get the sheaves under cover! | Rain on the stooks. That's half lost.

rule x7_rain_watch
when concept=react.rain self.role=guard self.on_watch=yes
cooldown 2h
say Wonderful. Another wet watch. | Wet fur and a long shift. | Rain on the helmet. Lovely music.

rule x7_rain_rich
when concept=react.rain self.wealth=rich
cooldown 2h
say My good coat! | Somebody fetch me a carriage. Not that there's ever one. | Somebody hold something over me! Anything!

rule x7_rain_homeless
when concept=react.rain self.homeless=yes
priority 1
cooldown 2h
say Nowhere dry tonight. | Where now, then? | The arch by the chapel. If it's not taken.

rule x7_rain_devout
when concept=react.rain self.piety=devout
cooldown 2h
say The Bright One waters the fields. Be thankful. | A blessing, this. A wet one, but a blessing. | Give thanks. Even for this.

rule x7_rain_merry
when concept=react.rain self.humour=merry
cooldown 2h
say Free bath! | Smells better already, this street. | Dance with me! No? Suit yourselves!

rule x7_rain_dry
when concept=react.rain self.humour=dry
cooldown 2h
say Splendid. I'd nearly dried from yesterday. | Ah. The weather. Here it is again. | Who ordered this?

rule x7_rain_dry_summer
when concept=react.rain self.humour=dry here.season=summer
cooldown 6h
say Ah. Summer. | Another glorious summer's day. | Summer, they call this. Somebody tell the sky.

rule x7_rain_nervy
when concept=react.rain self.temper=nervy
cooldown 2h
say Is that thunder? Is it going to thunder? | Oh, I left the shutters open! | Hurry, hurry!

rule x7_rain_short
when concept=react.rain self.temper=short
cooldown 2h
say Oh, of course. | Of course it's raining. Of course! | Every time I step outside!

rule x7_rain_calm
when concept=react.rain self.temper=calm
cooldown 2h
say Rain. Well, it'll pass. | No point running. You'll only be wet and tired. | Nice sound, rain.

rule x7_rain_winter
when concept=react.rain here.season=winter
cooldown 2h
say Sleet. Proper sleet. | Freezing rain. The worst kind. | It'll be ice by dark, mark me.

rule x7_rain_summer
when concept=react.rain here.season=summer
cooldown 2h
say Thank the gods. It's been close all week. | Ah, that's better. Cools the stones. | Warm rain. Not so bad.

rule x7_rain_autumn
when concept=react.rain here.season=autumn
cooldown 2h
say Leaves'll be down after this. | And so it starts. Rain till spring. | Autumn's here, then.

rule x7_rain_storm
when concept=react.rain here.weather=storm
priority 1
cooldown 1h
say Shutters! That's a storm, not a shower! | Get inside! All of you, inside! | Hear that wind? That's no shower.

rule x7_rain_ridgemere
when concept=react.rain here.region=ridgemere
cooldown 2h
say Ridgemere weather. As promised. | When doesn't it rain here? | The gutters'll be over the step by dark.

rule x7_rain_mirebridge
when concept=react.rain here.region=mirebridge
cooldown 2h
say Wetter fens. Just what we needed. | The river'll be up by morning. | Nobody in Mirebridge has been dry since spring.

rule x7_rain_frost
when concept=react.rain here.region=frosthollow|coldwater
cooldown 2h
say Off the peaks, this. You can taste the snow in it. | Cold rain off the peaks. Brr. | That'll freeze on the path tonight.

rule x7_rain_home
when concept=react.rain here.place=home|street self.parent=yes
cooldown 2h
say Washing! Who's bringing the washing in? | Pups, in! In! | Shut the window, it's coming in sideways.

rule x7_rain_carter
when concept=react.rain self.job=carter
cooldown 2h
say Roads'll be soup by morning. | Cover the load! | Wet wheels, heavy mud, slow going.

rule x7_rain_laborer
when concept=react.rain self.job=laborer self.working=yes
cooldown 2h
say Mortar won't set in this. | Tarp! Tarp over the lime! | That's the scaffold slippery. Careful up there.

rule x7_rain_night
when concept=react.rain here.time=night
cooldown 2h
say Rain in the dark. Good sleeping weather, at least. | Lanterns out, and now this. | Get home, get home.

rule x7_rain_festival
when concept=react.rain here.day=festival here.festival
priority 1
cooldown 2h
say Not on #here.festival#! | The bunting! Save the bunting! | Dance anyway! Dance in it!

rule x7_rain_market_day
when concept=react.rain here.day=market
cooldown 2h
say There goes market day. | Stalls down! Everybody under cover! | Market's done. Thanks, sky.

rule x7_rain_tired
when concept=react.rain self.tired=yes
cooldown 2h
say Fine. I'll just stand here and get wet. Too tired to run. | Wet and tired. Lovely combination. | Couldn't hurry if I tried.

## ---------------------------------------------------------------- A customer at the door (a: the keeper; b: the player)
## Every greeting remembers the customer (pair.mem.served, as the first rules do); many go on (then self: shop.pitch).

rule x7_cust_any
when concept=react.customer self.role=merchant
say #greet#. Look all you like. | Come in, come in, mind the step. | #greet#. Anything catch your eye, just shout. | In you come. Shut the door, there's a draught.
then self: shop.pitch
remember pair: served 7d

rule x7_cust_any2
when concept=react.customer
say #greet#! What can I do for you? | Hello, hello. Don't be shy. | There you are. I was beginning to think the town had emptied. | Yes? Come in, come in.
remember pair: served 7d

rule x7_cust_any3
when concept=react.customer self.role=merchant
say One moment, one moment. Right. #greet#. | Be with you in a breath. | #greet#. Mind the floor, it's just swept.
then self: shop.pitch
remember pair: served 7d

rule x7_cust_smith
when concept=react.customer self.job=smith
cooldown 1h
say Mind the forge, it bites. | #greet#. Something mended, or something new? | Stand back of the anvil and say your piece. | Shout, I'm half deaf from the hammer.
then self: shop.pitch
remember pair: served 7d

rule x7_cust_baker
when concept=react.customer self.job=baker
cooldown 1h
say #greet#! Shut the door, keep the heat in. | Smell that? That's the next batch. | Come in, it's warm by the ovens. | Flour on everything, sorry. Comes with the trade.
then self: shop.pitch
remember pair: served 7d

rule x7_cust_baker_dawn
when concept=react.customer self.job=baker here.time=dawn
cooldown 1h
say You're early! Loaves are still in. | Up with the bakers, are you? | First through the door. You get the pick.
then self: shop.pitch
remember pair: served 7d

rule x7_cust_brewer
when concept=react.customer self.job=brewer
cooldown 1h
say #greet#. Tasting's not free, before you ask. | Come in. Mind the barrels, they're full. | Thirsty? Course you are.
then self: shop.pitch
remember pair: served 7d

rule x7_cust_inn_night
when concept=react.customer self.job=innkeeper here.time=night|dusk
cooldown 1h
say Late one, is it? There's a bed if you've coin. | Come in out of the dark. Fire's still in. | Sit by the hearth. Supper's nearly gone, but not quite.
then self: shop.pitch
remember pair: served 7d

rule x7_cust_inn_morning
when concept=react.customer self.job=innkeeper here.time=dawn
cooldown 1h
say Breakfast's porridge. It's always porridge. | Early riser? Sit, sit. | Fire's only just lit. Mind the one asleep on the bench.
remember pair: served 7d

rule x7_cust_healer
when concept=react.customer self.job=healer
cooldown 1h
say #greet#. Where does it hurt? | Sit, sit. Let's have a look at you. | Nothing catching, I hope? | Come in. Mind the jars.
then self: shop.pitch
remember pair: served 7d

rule x7_cust_cook
when concept=react.customer self.job=cook
cooldown 1h
say Hungry? You've the look. | Pot's on. Sit where you like. | Come in, come in. Nobody leaves my door hungry.
then self: shop.pitch
remember pair: served 7d

rule x7_cust_crafter
when concept=react.customer self.job=crafter
cooldown 1h
say #greet#. Careful of the shelves. | Everything here made by my own paws. | Come in. Touch what you like, break nothing.
then self: shop.pitch
remember pair: served 7d

rule x7_cust_merchant
when concept=react.customer self.job=merchant
cooldown 1h
say #greet#! Everything priced fair. More or less. | Come in! Browse, browse. | Come in! Mind the crates, I've not unpacked.
then self: shop.pitch
remember pair: served 7d

rule x7_cust_farmer
when concept=react.customer self.job=farmer|herder
cooldown 1h
say Buying straight from the field? Sensible. | Mind where you step. | You're a long way from the market, friend.
remember pair: served 7d

rule x7_cust_fisher
when concept=react.customer self.job=fisher
cooldown 1h
say Mind the bucket. Fresh in this morning. | Smell's free. The fish isn't. | Come for the catch? Good timing.
then self: shop.pitch
remember pair: served 7d

rule x7_cust_guard
when concept=react.customer self.role=guard
cooldown 1h
say Visitors wait by the door. | You here to report something? | State your business. | Lost something? Found something? Done something?
remember pair: served 7d

rule x7_cust_priest
when concept=react.customer self.job=priest
cooldown 1h
say Welcome to the Bright One's house. | Come in. All are welcome here. | Rest a while. The benches don't bite. | Peace on you, traveller.
remember pair: served 7d

rule x7_cust_official
when concept=react.customer self.job=official
cooldown 1h
say Have you an appointment? | Petitions on the left, complaints on the right, nonsense outside. | Take a seat. We'll get to you. Eventually.
remember pair: served 7d

rule x7_cust_scholar
when concept=react.customer self.job=scholar
cooldown 1h
say Quietly, please. | Ah. A visitor. Don't touch the books. | Hm? Oh. Yes. Hello. Is it noon already?
remember pair: served 7d

rule x7_cust_servant
when concept=react.customer self.job=servant
cooldown 1h
say Tradesmen round the back. Oh, you're not? Then what? | The master's not receiving. | Wipe your paws, please. I've only just done the floor.
remember pair: served 7d

rule x7_cust_noble
when concept=react.customer self.job=noble
cooldown 1h
say Who let you in? | Hm. One of the servants will see to you. | Yes? Be brief.
remember pair: served 7d

rule x7_cust_labour
when concept=react.customer self.job=laborer|miner|woodcutter
cooldown 1h
say Looking for work? There's always work. | Mind your head, they're hoisting. | You're not dressed for this.
remember pair: served 7d

rule x7_cust_apprentice
when concept=react.customer self.job=apprentice
cooldown 1h
say Master's out the back. I can help! Probably. | Oh! Customer! Um. Hello! | Welcome! I'm only learning, so be kind.
remember pair: served 7d

rule x7_cust_carter
when concept=react.customer self.job=carter
cooldown 1h
say Going somewhere? I'm off at first light. | Room on the cart, if you pay. | Mind the mule. She bites.
remember pair: served 7d

rule x7_cust_sailor
when concept=react.customer self.job=sailor
cooldown 1h
say Looking for passage? Ask the mate. | Mind the ropes. | Landlubber, eh? Come in, come in.
remember pair: served 7d

rule x7_cust_gruff
when concept=react.customer self.tone=gruff
cooldown 1h
say What? | Well? | Buying, or looking? | Shut the door.
remember pair: served 7d

rule x7_cust_formal
when concept=react.customer self.tone=formal
cooldown 1h
say Good day. How may I serve? | Welcome. Please, take your time. | Good day to you. Do let me know what you require.
then self: shop.pitch
remember pair: served 7d

rule x7_cust_sly
when concept=react.customer self.tone=sly
cooldown 1h
say Ah, a discerning sort. I can always tell. | Come in. I've just the thing, whatever it is. | Well now. What brings you to my door?
then self: shop.pitch
remember pair: served 7d

rule x7_cust_shy
when concept=react.customer self.tone=shy
cooldown 1h
say Oh! Um. Hello. Let me know if... yes. | H-hello. Welcome. | Oh. A customer. Hello.
remember pair: served 7d

rule x7_cust_warm
when concept=react.customer self.tone=warm
cooldown 1h
say Come in, come in, don't stand in the door! | Welcome, welcome! Sit if you like. | Oh, hello! Lovely to see a face.
then self: shop.pitch
remember pair: served 7d

rule x7_cust_chatty
when concept=react.customer self.talk=chatty
cooldown 1h
say Come in! You'll never guess what happened this morning. No, never mind. What are you after? | Hello! Busy day, busy day, I've not sat down once. Now, what can I do you for?
then self: shop.pitch
remember pair: served 7d

rule x7_cust_quiet
when concept=react.customer self.talk=quiet
cooldown 1h
say Mm. | Hello. | Mm. Look around.
remember pair: served 7d

rule x7_cust_merry
when concept=react.customer self.humour=merry
cooldown 1h
say Welcome! Leave your troubles at the door. I'll mind them. | Come in! Mind the cat. There's no cat. Come in! | Ha! A visitor! Quick, everyone look busy.
then self: shop.pitch
remember pair: served 7d

rule x7_cust_dry
when concept=react.customer self.humour=dry
cooldown 1h
say A customer. I'll mark it on the calendar. | Ah. Someone. | Come in. Don't mind the silence, it's the fashion.
remember pair: served 7d

rule x7_cust_short
when concept=react.customer self.temper=short
cooldown 1h
say Shut the door. Were you born in a barn? | Wipe your paws. | Yes, yes, I see you.
remember pair: served 7d

rule x7_cust_nervy
when concept=react.customer self.temper=nervy
cooldown 1h
say Oh! You startled me. | Gods, I didn't hear the door. Hello. | Oh. Oh, hello. Sorry. Hello.
remember pair: served 7d

rule x7_cust_dawn
when concept=react.customer here.time=dawn
cooldown 2h
say Barely open, mind. | Early bird. Come in. | Give me a moment, I've not even had my porridge.
remember pair: served 7d

rule x7_cust_night
when concept=react.customer here.time=night
cooldown 2h
say We're closing soon, be quick. | Late, isn't it? Come in, then. | Lamp's low. What'll it be?
remember pair: served 7d

rule x7_cust_market
when concept=react.customer here.day=market self.role=merchant
cooldown 2h
say Market day! Quick, before it's gone. | Busy one today. Who's next? You? Good. | Mind the crush. What'll it be?
then self: shop.pitch
remember pair: served 7d

rule x7_cust_rest
when concept=react.customer here.day=rest self.role=merchant
cooldown 2h
say Shut, really, for Restday. Oh, go on. | Restday. Half the stock's away. | Come in. Don't tell the priest.
remember pair: served 7d

rule x7_cust_festival
when concept=react.customer here.day=festival here.festival
cooldown 2h
say Happy #here.festival#! | Shouldn't you be out dancing? | Come in! The whole town's out, it's lovely and quiet in here.
remember pair: served 7d

rule x7_cust_winter
when concept=react.customer here.season=winter
cooldown 2h
say Shut that door, you're letting the winter in! | Come by the fire. Brr. | Stamp your boots, you're bringing half the road in.
remember pair: served 7d

rule x7_cust_visit
when concept=react.customer self.role!=merchant
say #greet#. Looking for someone? | Can I help you? | Hello. Lost, are you? | Yes? What can I do for you?
remember pair: served 7d

rule x7_cust_visit2
when concept=react.customer self.role!=merchant
say Oh! A visitor. #greet#. | Come in, if you're coming. | Hello there. Mind where you tread.
remember pair: served 7d

rule x7_cust_thriving
when concept=react.customer self.business=thriving
cooldown 1h
say Busy, mind. Wait your turn. | Come in! Can't stop, but come in. | Everyone's in today. Squeeze in.
then self: shop.pitch
remember pair: served 7d

rule x7_cust_failing2
when concept=react.customer self.business=failing
cooldown 1h
say Oh! Come in! Please, take your time. | You're my first today. First all day. | Anything you want, I'll find a price.
then self: shop.pitch
remember pair: served 7d

rule x7_cust_crowd
when concept=react.customer here.crowd=crowd
cooldown 1h
say Bit of a crush. Wait your turn. | One at a time! One at a time! | Squeeze in, squeeze in.
remember pair: served 7d

rule x7_cust_frost
when concept=react.customer here.region=frosthollow|coldwater here.season=winter
cooldown 2h
say Stamp the snow off, there's a dear. | Come in, quick, the cold follows you. | Paws to the stove. You look frozen.
remember pair: served 7d

rule x7_cust_fens
when concept=react.customer here.region=mirebridge
cooldown 2h
say Wipe the mud, please. Everyone brings the fen in. | Come in. Mind the wet patch. There's always a wet patch.
remember pair: served 7d

## How they feel about this customer

rule x7_cust_hostile
when concept=react.customer pair.disposition=hostile
priority 2
say You. Out. | I've nothing for you. | Not you. Not in here. | Don't touch anything. Better yet, leave.
remember pair: served 7d

rule x7_cust_wary
when concept=react.customer pair.disposition=wary
priority 1
say Mind what you touch. | Hm. I'm watching you. | What do you want? | You. Hm. Go on, then.
remember pair: served 7d

rule x7_cust_cool
when concept=react.customer pair.disposition=cool
priority 1
say Aye. | Oh. It's you. | Hm. What'll it be?
remember pair: served 7d

rule x7_cust_warm_known
when concept=react.customer pair.disposition=warm topic.player
priority 1
say #topic.player#! Come in, come in. | Ah, #topic.player#. Good to see you. | There's #topic.player#. What'll it be today?
then self: shop.pitch
remember pair: served 7d

rule x7_cust_fond
when concept=react.customer pair.disposition=fond
priority 1
say My favourite customer! | There you are! I was hoping you'd come by. | Oh, come in! Sit down, sit down. | You! Come in, sit, sit.
then self: shop.pitch
remember pair: served 7d

rule x7_cust_fond_known
when concept=react.customer pair.disposition=fond topic.player
priority 1
say #topic.player#! My favourite customer! | #topic.player#, #pet#! Come in! | Oh, #topic.player#! The day's looking up.
then self: shop.pitch
remember pair: served 7d

rule x7_cust_served_known
when concept=react.customer pair.mem.served topic.player
priority 1
cooldown 1h
say #topic.player#! The usual? | Back again, #topic.player#? I'll start thinking you like me. | #topic.player#. Thought I'd see you today.
then self: shop.pitch
remember pair: served 7d

rule x7_cust_served
when concept=react.customer pair.mem.served
priority 1
cooldown 1h
say You again! Can't keep away, can you? | Ah, I know that face. Welcome back. | Back for more? Good. | Twice in a week. I'll give you a stool of your own.
then self: shop.pitch
remember pair: served 7d

rule x7_cust_thief
when concept=react.customer pair.rumour=thief
priority 2
say Everything's counted, just so you know. | Paws out of your pockets, where I can see them. | I've heard about you. Look with your eyes.
remember pair: served 7d

rule x7_cust_violent
when concept=react.customer pair.rumour=violent
priority 2
say No trouble in here. I mean it. | I've heard what you did. Not in my shop. | Easy. Easy. What do you want?
remember pair: served 7d

rule x7_cust_promises
when concept=react.customer pair.rumour=breaks_promises
priority 1
say Coin first, talk after. | No credit. Not for you. | I'll believe it when it's paid.
remember pair: served 7d

rule x7_cust_famous
when concept=react.customer pair.famous=yes
priority 1
say It's you! The one they all talk about! | Well! In my shop! Wait till I tell the neighbours. | I know you. Everyone knows you. Come in!
then self: shop.pitch
remember pair: served 7d

rule x7_cust_they_owe
when concept=react.customer pair.owed=b
priority 1
say You'll be settling up today, I trust? | Before anything else: what you owe me. | Good. You've come to pay, then.
remember pair: served 7d

rule x7_cust_i_owe
when concept=react.customer pair.owed=a
priority 1
say I've not forgotten what I owe you. Soon, I promise. | Ah. Yes. About the money. Soon. | Don't look at me like that, I'll pay you back.
remember pair: served 7d

rule x7_cust_long_gone
when concept=react.customer pair.days_since>=14
priority 2
say Well! Haven't seen you in an age! | Thought you'd found another shop. | There you are! I'd near given you up.
then self: shop.pitch
remember pair: served 7d

rule x7_cust_mourning
when concept=react.customer self.mourning=kin
priority 3
say Oh. Come in. Forgive the state of me. We've had a death. | We're open. Just. What do you need? | Come in. Don't mind me.
remember pair: served 7d

rule x7_cust_hurt
when concept=react.customer self.injured=bad|light
priority 2
say Come in. Mind, I'm moving slow today. | Took a knock this week. Go gently with me. | Ooh. Hello. Don't make me reach for anything high.
remember pair: served 7d

rule x7_cust_robbed
when concept=react.customer self.robbed=yes
priority 2
say Come in. Mind, I've been robbed this week, so I'm watching everyone. | Not you, I hope? No. Sorry. Come in. | Everything's counted twice now. Thieves.
remember pair: served 7d

## ---------------------------------------------------------------- The keeper goes on (shop.pitch; self: the keeper)
## Those who sell nothing (the watch at their post, a priest in the chapel, a clerk) go on as hosts, not sellers.

rule x7_pitch_host
when concept=shop.pitch self.role!=merchant self.job=guard|priest|official|scholar|servant|noble|laborer|miner|woodcutter|herder|farmer|soldier|apprentice|carter|sailor|none|child|beggar
priority 3
say Anyway. What brings you? | Well. Say what you need. | I'm not selling anything, mind, if that's what you're after. | Sit if you like. Or don't.

rule x7_pitch_any
when concept=shop.pitch
say Ask if you want anything. I'll be right here. | Prices on the board. Well, in my head. Ask. | Take your time. No hurry. | Everything's fair priced, whatever they tell you up the street.

rule x7_pitch_any2
when concept=shop.pitch
say If you don't see it, ask. I might have it out back. | Nothing here'll fall apart in a week, I promise you that. | Don't mind the dust. The goods are clean.

rule x7_pitch_baker
when concept=shop.pitch self.job=baker
say Rye's good today. Honey loaf if you're feeling rich. | Barley rolls a penny, and worth two. | Seed cake, fresh. Don't tell the neighbours. | Crust's the best part, and I'll hear no different.

rule x7_pitch_baker_dusk
when concept=shop.pitch self.job=baker here.time=dusk|night
say What's left is half price. Yesterday's is a gift. | Last loaves. Take two, I'll not sell them tomorrow.

rule x7_pitch_smith
when concept=shop.pitch self.job=smith
say Good knife there, holds an edge. | Hinges, nails, a pot if you need one. | Bring me anything bent and I'll make it straight. | Bronze is cheap, iron's better, steel's for the rich.

rule x7_pitch_brewer
when concept=shop.pitch self.job=brewer
say The dark's strong, the pale's sweet, the cider's from Southmeadow. | New barrel tapped yesterday. | Small beer for the thirsty, strong for the sad.

rule x7_pitch_inn
when concept=shop.pitch self.job=innkeeper
say Stew's mutton today. Again. | Bed's two pennies, with a blanket three. | Ale's honest measure. Nobody waters it but the rain.

rule x7_pitch_healer
when concept=shop.pitch self.job=healer
say Willow bark for the head, comfrey for bruises. | Got a salve for sore pads that'd make you weep with joy. | If it's a cough, I've just the thing. If it's a broken heart, try the tavern.

rule x7_pitch_cook
when concept=shop.pitch self.job=cook
say Pie, broth, or both? | Mutton pie's hot. The broth'll stand a spoon up. | Sit. Eat. Talk after.

rule x7_pitch_crafter
when concept=shop.pitch self.job=crafter
say Baskets, belts, a comb for your ruff. | That jug's my best. Don't drop it. | I'll make anything to order, give me a week.

rule x7_pitch_fisher
when concept=shop.pitch self.job=fisher
say Whatever the water gave up this morning, it's here. | Smoked or fresh. The smoked keeps. | Caught at dawn. Eat it by dusk.

rule x7_pitch_merchant
when concept=shop.pitch self.job=merchant
say Whatever you're after, I've likely got it. Somewhere. | Most of this came up the road this week. | I've what the road brings. Today it brought plenty.

rule x7_pitch_winter
when concept=shop.pitch here.season=winter
say Look by the stove, you'll thaw while you choose. | Winter prices, I'm afraid. Blame the roads.

rule x7_pitch_summer
when concept=shop.pitch here.season=summer
say Mind the flies. They've no manners. | Cool in here, at least. Stay a while.

rule x7_pitch_failing
when concept=shop.pitch self.business=failing
priority 1
say Everything's a bit cheaper today. Don't ask why. | I'll do you a good price. A very good price. | Buy two, I'll... I'll think of something.

rule x7_pitch_thriving
when concept=shop.pitch self.business=thriving
say Going fast today. Don't dither. | Last of that, it's been flying. | Can't keep it on the shelves.

rule x7_pitch_dawn
when concept=shop.pitch here.time=dawn
say First through the door gets the best of it. | You've first pick. Lucky you.

rule x7_pitch_night
when concept=shop.pitch here.time=night
say What's left is cheap. Make me an offer. | Be quick. My bed's calling.

rule x7_pitch_sly
when concept=shop.pitch self.honesty=sly
say For you, a special price. Don't tell anyone. | That one? Oh, you've an eye. Everyone wants that one. | I'd not sell this to just anybody.

rule x7_pitch_frank
when concept=shop.pitch self.honesty=frank
say Half of this is good and half's tired. I'll tell you which. | Don't buy the cheap one. It's cheap for a reason. | That's overpriced. Everyone's is. Mine's less.

rule x7_pitch_chatty
when concept=shop.pitch self.talk=chatty
say My cousin swears by these, and she swears by everything, so. | Did you hear about the miller? No? Well, buy something and I'll tell you.

rule x7_pitch_merry
when concept=shop.pitch self.humour=merry
say Buy one, get one. The second one costs the same, but still. | Everything here's guaranteed until you leave the shop.

rule x7_pitch_market
when concept=shop.pitch here.day=market
say Market prices today. Which is to say, same as always but louder. | Everyone's buying today. Don't get left out.

rule x7_pitch_famous
when concept=shop.pitch pair.famous=yes
say Take anything. Well, not anything. But look! | Tell folk you got it here. That's all I ask.

## ---------------------------------------------------------------- Friends passing (a greets b; b answers; sometimes more)
## (react.friend fires only for two residents who are friends: pair.band is always friends here.)
## Each opener remembers what kind of thing it said, so the answer fits it: fg (a greeting: hail, ask, wet, cold,
## tired, hurt, grief, robbed), ft (a tease: looks, owe, pup, neigh), fi (an invitation: plain, feed, play, fest), fq (news
## raised), fp (a leave-taking: light, funeral, blessing); every answer that wants a last word remembers its stance (fx).

rule x7_fr_hello
when concept=react.friend
priority 1
cooldown 3h
say #other.name#! | Well, look who it is. | There's a face I know. | #greet#, #pet#! | Oi! #other.name#!
then other: greet.answer
remember pair: fg=hail 30m

rule x7_fr_hello2
when concept=react.friend
priority 1
cooldown 3h
say Still alive, then? How's things? | How goes it, #pet#? | All well with you? | And how's the world treating you, #other.name#?
then other: greet.answer
remember pair: fg=ask 30m

rule x7_fr_hello3
when concept=react.friend
priority 1
cooldown 3h
say Haven't seen you in an age. How've you been? | You look well. Annoyingly well. How do you manage it? | What news, #other.name#? How are you keeping? | #other.name#! Just the wolf. How are you?
then other: greet.answer
remember pair: fg=ask 30m

rule x7_fr_where
when concept=react.friend
priority 1
cooldown 3h
say Where are you off to in such a hurry? | Off somewhere? | Where are you going, #pet#? | What's the hurry, #other.name#?
then other: friend.where

rule x7_fr_where_night
when concept=react.friend here.time=night
cooldown 6h
say What are you doing out at this hour? | Up late, aren't you? Where to? | You're never out this late. Where are you off to?
then other: friend.where

rule x7_fr_where_rest
when concept=react.friend here.day=rest here.time=dawn|day
cooldown 1d
say Blessed Restday! Chapel, or idleness? | Restday! Where are you off to? | Off to chapel, or off to the tavern?
then other: friend.where

rule x7_fr_tease
when concept=react.friend
priority 1
cooldown 6h
say Is that a new coat, or did you sleep in it? | You've got something on your muzzle. No, the other side. | Walking like you own the street again. | Look at the state of your fur.
then other: friend.tease
remember pair: ft=looks 30m

rule x7_fr_tease_merry
when concept=react.friend self.humour=merry
cooldown 6h
say Here comes trouble! | Hide the pies, #other.name#'s about. | Ah! The best-looking wolf in #here.town#. After me. | Mind your tail, #other.name#, it's dragging. Oh, it's meant to do that.
then other: friend.tease
remember pair: ft=looks 30m

rule x7_fr_tease_dry
when concept=react.friend self.humour=dry
cooldown 6h
say Ah. You. My day was going so well. | You look like you've been dragged here backwards. | I see you've dressed for the occasion. Which occasion, I couldn't say.
then other: friend.tease
remember pair: ft=looks 30m

rule x7_fr_tease_owe
when concept=react.friend self.tone=gruff other.stage=adult|old
cooldown 1d
say You still owe me #drink#. | Don't think I've forgotten the cards. | You. Still got my good knife?
then other: friend.tease
remember pair: ft=owe 30m

rule x7_fr_owed
when concept=react.friend pair.owed=b other.stage=adult|old
cooldown 1d
say Ah, my favourite debtor. | There goes my money, with you wrapped round it. | Walking past me with my money in your purse, are you?
then other: friend.tease
remember pair: ft=owe 30m

rule x7_fr_tease_old
when concept=react.friend self.stage=old other.stage=young|adolescent
cooldown 1d
say Look at you! Grown a paw since last week! | Mind your manners, pup. | Still causing trouble, are you?
then other: friend.tease
remember pair: ft=pup 30m

rule x7_fr_invite
when concept=react.friend other.stage=adult|old
cooldown 1d
say Come round soon. It's been too long. | We should sit down properly, the two of us. Restday? | Supper at ours, soon. No excuses. | Come by later. I've something to show you.
then other: friend.invite
remember pair: fi=plain 30m

rule x7_fr_invite_tavern
when concept=react.friend here.time=dusk|night self.stage=adult|old other.stage=adult|old
cooldown 2d
say One at the tavern? Just one. | Come on, I'm buying. Once. | Tavern? My throat's dry as a chapel floor. | Come round tonight. I've #drink# with your name on it.
then other: friend.invite
remember pair: fi=plain 30m

rule x7_fr_invite_young
when concept=react.friend self.stage=young other.stage=young
cooldown 3h
say Coming to play? | Race you to the well! | Want to see a frog? I've got a frog. | Let's play Watch and thieves! You're the thief.
then other: friend.invite
remember pair: fi=play 30m

rule x7_fr_invite_festival
when concept=react.friend here.day=festival here.festival
cooldown 6h
say Happy #here.festival#! Dance with me later? | Coming to see the fun? | Save me a place by the fire tonight!
then other: friend.invite
remember pair: fi=fest 30m

rule x7_fr_see_hungry
when concept=react.friend other.hungry=yes self.wealth=comfortable|rich
cooldown 1d
say You look half starved. Come and eat with us tonight. | There's a pot on at mine. You're coming, and that's that. | When did you last eat? Come to supper. I mean it.
then other: friend.invite
remember pair: fi=feed 30m

rule x7_fr_news_tease
when concept=react.friend self.talk=chatty
cooldown 6h
say Wait, wait, I've news. No, it'll keep. No, it won't. Later! | You'll never guess who I saw this morning. Never! | Did you hear the row last night? Half the street did.
then other: friend.news
remember pair: fq=gossip 30m

rule x7_fr_news_wedding
when concept=react.friend world.wedding=recent
cooldown 1d
say Were you at the wedding? | Lovely wedding, wasn't it? | Did you see the bride's mother cry? Buckets!
then other: friend.news
remember pair: fq=wedding 30m

rule x7_fr_news_death
when concept=react.friend world.death=recent
cooldown 1d
say Sad news, wasn't it. | You'll have heard the sad news. | Will you be at the burying?
then other: friend.news
remember pair: fq=death 30m

rule x7_fr_news_birth
when concept=react.friend world.birth=recent
cooldown 1d
say Heard about the new pup? | There's a new little one in town! Have you seen? | Another pup! The town's growing.
then other: friend.news
remember pair: fq=birth 30m

rule x7_fr_news_bandits
when concept=react.friend world.bandits=near
cooldown 1d
say Heard about the #bandits# on the road? | You're not going out on the road, are you? With the #bandits# about? | They hit another caravan, did you hear?
then other: friend.news
remember pair: fq=bandits 30m

rule x7_fr_news_crime
when concept=react.friend world.crime=recent
cooldown 1d
say Did you hear about the trouble? | Bar your door tonight. There's been trouble about. | The Watch was round asking questions. Did they come to you?
then other: friend.news
remember pair: fq=crime 30m

rule x7_fr_news_festival
when concept=react.friend world.festival=soon
cooldown 1d
say Festival soon! Are you going? | Got your festival coat brushed yet? | Only days till the festival!
then other: friend.news
remember pair: fq=festival 30m

rule x7_fr_news_prices
when concept=react.friend world.meal_price=up
cooldown 1d
say Have you seen what a meal costs now? | Prices! Did you see the prices? | I paid near double for supper yesterday.
then other: friend.news
remember pair: fq=prices 30m

rule x7_fr_news_herbs
when concept=react.friend world.herbs_price=up
cooldown 1d
say Herbs are up again, did you see? | What's a bundle of herbs now? A week's #wages#? | My mother's cough mixture costs more than my supper now.
then other: friend.news
remember pair: fq=prices 30m

rule x7_fr_ask_child
when concept=react.friend other.child
cooldown 1d
say How's #other.child#? | And #other.child#? Behaving? | Give #other.child# my love. Keeping well, are they?
then other: friend.news
remember pair: fq=child 30m

rule x7_fr_ask_spouse
when concept=react.friend other.spouse
cooldown 1d
say And how's #other.spouse#? | Give my best to #other.spouse#. How are they? | #other.spouse# keeping well?
then other: friend.news
remember pair: fq=spouse 30m

rule x7_fr_ask_shop_good
when concept=react.friend other.business=thriving
cooldown 1d
say Doing well, I hear! Run off your paws. | Look at you, a wolf of business! | They say you can't keep up with the custom.
then other: friend.news
remember pair: fq=shop 30m

rule x7_fr_ask_shop_bad
when concept=react.friend other.business=failing
cooldown 1d
say How's trade? Truly? | Quiet at yours, I hear. Holding up? | If you need a paw with the business, you say.
then other: friend.news
remember pair: fq=shop 30m

rule x7_fr_ask_work
when concept=react.friend other.working=yes other.shift=during
cooldown 6h
say Don't let me keep you from your work. | Hard at it? I'll not stop you. | Busy, I see. I'll leave you be.
then other: friend.parting
remember pair: fp=light 30m

rule x7_fr_see_tired
when concept=react.friend other.tired=yes
cooldown 6h
say You look done in. | Gods, you look like you've not slept in a week. | When did you last sleep?
then other: greet.answer
remember pair: fg=tired 30m

rule x7_fr_see_hurt
when concept=react.friend other.injured=light|bad
priority 1
cooldown 6h
say What've you done to yourself? | Gods! Who did that? | You're limping. What happened?
then other: greet.answer
remember pair: fg=hurt 30m

rule x7_fr_see_grief
when concept=react.friend other.mourning=kin|friend
priority 2
cooldown 1d
say I'm so sorry, #pet#. If you need anything. Anything. | I heard. I'm sorry. | Come here. I'm so sorry.
then other: greet.answer
remember pair: fg=grief 30m

rule x7_fr_see_robbed
when concept=react.friend other.robbed=yes
priority 1
cooldown 1d
say I heard they robbed you! Are you all right? | Robbed! You! Did they hurt you? | Any word from the Watch, about your things?
then other: greet.answer
remember pair: fg=robbed 30m

rule x7_fr_see_widowed
when concept=react.friend other.widowed=yes other.mourning=no
cooldown 2d
say How are you managing, #pet#? On your own, I mean. | Are you eating properly? You can tell me. | Don't sit alone of an evening. You know where I live.
then other: greet.answer
remember pair: fg=widow 30m

rule x7_fr_self_errand
when concept=react.friend self.errand=letter|goods|order
cooldown 6h
say Can't stop! Errand to run. | #greet#! Can't talk, I'm late with this. | Ha, can't stop, #pet#. Business!
then other: friend.parting
remember pair: fp=light 30m

rule x7_fr_self_wedding
when concept=react.friend self.errand=wedding
cooldown 6h
say Can't stop! Wedding! | Do I look all right? Tell me I look all right. It's a wedding. | Off to the wedding! See you there?
then other: friend.parting
remember pair: fp=light 30m

rule x7_fr_self_funeral
when concept=react.friend self.errand=funeral
priority 1
cooldown 6h
say Off to the burying. | Can't stop. The funeral. | Keep them in your thoughts today, will you?
then other: friend.parting
remember pair: fp=funeral 30m

rule x7_fr_neighbours
when concept=react.friend pair.neighbours=yes
cooldown 6h
say Was that your lot banging half the night? | Your gutter's dripping on my step again. | Your cat's been in my yard again. | Is that your washing on my line?
then other: friend.tease
remember pair: ft=neigh 30m

rule x7_fr_neighbours_hello
when concept=react.friend pair.neighbours=yes
cooldown 6h
say #greet#, neighbour! | There's my neighbour! | Hello, next door!
then other: greet.answer
remember pair: fg=hail 30m

rule x7_fr_flock_priest
when concept=react.friend pair.flock=a
cooldown 1d
say I missed you at chapel, #other.name#. | Bright One keep you. Will we see you Restday? | You look troubled. Come and sit in the chapel a while.
then other: friend.news
remember pair: fq=chapel 30m

rule x7_fr_flock_faithful
when concept=react.friend pair.flock=b
cooldown 1d
say Blessings to you. | Good day! I'll be at chapel Restday, I promise. | The candle you lit for us, thank you. It helped.
then other: friend.parting
remember pair: fp=blessing 30m

rule x7_fr_customer_buyer
when concept=react.friend pair.customer=a
cooldown 1d
say Keep one by for me, will you? | Is my order ready yet? | I'll be by the shop later. Keep me the good one.
then other: friend.news
remember pair: fq=order 30m

rule x7_fr_customer_seller
when concept=react.friend pair.customer=b
cooldown 1d
say Coming by the shop? I've something put aside for you. | You've not been in this week. Found another shop, have you? | Got your favourite in, if you're passing.
then other: friend.news
remember pair: fq=shop_visit 30m

rule x7_fr_dawn
when concept=react.friend here.time=dawn
cooldown 6h
say Up early! How are you? | You're up before the larks. All well? | Morning! Have you slept at all?
then other: greet.answer
remember pair: fg=ask 30m

rule x7_fr_rain
when concept=react.friend here.weather=rain|storm
cooldown 6h
say Wet enough for you? | Lovely day for it! | You look like a drowned rat. A friendly drowned rat.
then other: greet.answer
remember pair: fg=wet 30m

rule x7_fr_cold
when concept=react.friend here.season=winter here.weather!=indoors
cooldown 1d
say #cold.capitalize# enough for you? | Brr! Keep moving or you'll freeze to the spot. | Is your nose as cold as mine?
then other: greet.answer
remember pair: fg=cold 30m

rule x7_fr_market
when concept=react.friend here.day=market self.stage!=young
cooldown 1d
say Going to the market? Get me some onions. | Market! If you see good eggs, get me six. | If you're passing the stalls, a bit of cheese for me?
then other: friend.news
remember pair: fq=favour 30m

rule x7_fr_chatty
when concept=react.friend self.talk=chatty
cooldown 6h
say Oh, I'm glad I caught you, I've been meaning to tell you, no, wait, how are you first? | #other.name#! Stop, stop, I've not talked to a soul all day. How are you?
then other: greet.answer
remember pair: fg=ask 30m

rule x7_fr_warm
when concept=react.friend self.warmth=warm
cooldown 6h
say Come here, #pet#. | Oh, it does my heart good to see you. | There you are! I was only thinking of you.
then other: greet.answer
remember pair: fg=hail 30m

rule x7_fr_quiet
when concept=react.friend self.talk=quiet
cooldown 6h
say #other.name#. | Mm. Hello. | All right?
then other: greet.answer
remember pair: fg=hail 30m

rule x7_fr_formal
when concept=react.friend self.tone=formal
cooldown 6h
say Good day, #other.name#. You are well, I trust? | Ah, #other.name#. A pleasure, as ever. You keep well? | Good day to you. Well, I hope?
then other: greet.answer
remember pair: fg=ask 30m

rule x7_fr_cold_warmth
when concept=react.friend self.warmth=cold
cooldown 6h
say #other.name#. | Oh. You. Hello. | Hm. Hello.
then other: greet.answer
remember pair: fg=hail 30m

## b answers a greeting (greet.answer; self: the one answering), as the greeting was (pair.mem.fg). chains.talk's
## greet_friend sets no fg, so its own answers there take it. An answer that wants a last word marks its stance (fx).

## A hail ("Oi! Bram!", "There's my neighbour!"): a greeting back, and on.

rule x7_ga_hail
when concept=greet.answer pair.mem.fg=hail
say #greet#! Good to see you. | Ha! You again. | There's a sight for sore eyes. | Well, well. Hello yourself. | #other.name#! The very wolf.

rule x7_ga_hail2
when concept=greet.answer pair.mem.fg=hail
say #greet#, #pet#! Can't stop. | And you, #pet#, and you. | Hello, hello! Mind how you go.

rule x7_ga_hail_merry
when concept=greet.answer pair.mem.fg=hail self.humour=merry
say Ha! They let you out again? | Hide the silver, it's #other.name#! | There's my favourite nuisance.

rule x7_ga_hail_dry
when concept=greet.answer pair.mem.fg=hail self.humour=dry
say Oh, it's you. I'd hoped it was someone else. Ha. | Still haunting this street, then. | Present, as ever.

rule x7_ga_hail_cold
when concept=greet.answer pair.mem.fg=hail self.warmth=cold
say Mm. Hello. | #other.name#. | Aye.

rule x7_ga_hail_young
when concept=greet.answer pair.mem.fg=hail self.stage=young
priority 1
say Hello! I can whistle now! Listen! | Shh! I'm hunting! | It's you! Hello!

rule x7_ga_hail_grief
when concept=greet.answer pair.mem.fg=hail self.mourning=kin|friend
priority 3
say Oh. Hello, #pet#. Forgive me, I'm not much company. | Hello. Sorry. My head's elsewhere. | Mm. Hello. We've had a loss.

## Asked how they are: as they are today.

rule x7_ga_any
when concept=greet.answer pair.mem.fg=ask
say Can't complain. Well, I can, but I won't. | Mustn't grumble. | Still here, still standing. | Oh, you know. Same as ever.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=ok 30m

rule x7_ga_any2
when concept=greet.answer pair.mem.fg=ask
say Better for seeing you. | Busy, busy. But well. | Not so bad, #pet#. Not so bad. | Well enough. Better than last week.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=ok 30m

rule x7_ga_any4
when concept=greet.answer pair.mem.fg=ask
say Fair to middling. | Oh, hanging on. | Up and down, #pet#. Up and down.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=meh 30m

rule x7_ga_tired
when concept=greet.answer pair.mem.fg=ask self.tired=yes
say Dead on my feet. | I could sleep in a puddle. | Tired. Bone tired.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=tired 30m

rule x7_ga_hungry
when concept=greet.answer pair.mem.fg=ask self.hungry=yes
say #hungry.capitalize#. Haven't eaten since yesterday. | Hungry enough to eat the cart. | Ask me after #supper#. If there is one.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=hungry 30m

rule x7_ga_poor
when concept=greet.answer pair.mem.fg=ask self.wealth=poor|destitute
say Scraping by. Just. | Counting pennies. Same as always. | Oh, you know. Thin week. Thin month.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=poor 30m

rule x7_ga_dole
when concept=greet.answer pair.mem.fg=ask self.on_dole=yes
say Living on #dole#, and grateful for it. | Getting by on the town's coin. Don't tell anyone. | Better than last month. #dole.capitalize# helps.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=poor 30m

rule x7_ga_owes
when concept=greet.answer pair.mem.fg=ask self.owes=yes
say Owing half the street, but otherwise fine. | Hiding from my creditors. Don't say you saw me. | In debt to my ears. Ears and tail.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=poor 30m

rule x7_ga_homeless
when concept=greet.answer pair.mem.fg=ask self.homeless=yes
priority 1
say Sleeping rough. Don't fuss. | No roof, but I'm alive. | Found a dry doorway last night. Luxury.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=poor 30m

rule x7_ga_rich
when concept=greet.answer pair.mem.fg=ask self.wealth=rich
say Very well indeed, thank you. | Splendid. Couldn't be better. | Oh, can't complain. Truly can't.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=good 30m

rule x7_ga_thriving
when concept=greet.answer pair.mem.fg=ask self.business=thriving
say Run off my paws! Never been busier. | Good! Busy! Too busy! | Selling faster than I can make it.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=good 30m

rule x7_ga_failing
when concept=greet.answer pair.mem.fg=ask self.business=failing
say Don't ask about trade. | Quiet. Too quiet. | I've sold three things this week. Three.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=bad 30m

rule x7_ga_hurt
when concept=greet.answer pair.mem.fg=ask self.injured=light|bad
priority 1
say Bit sore. Took a knock. | Don't ask. Don't touch, either. | I'll mend. Slowly.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=hurt 30m

rule x7_ga_robbed
when concept=greet.answer pair.mem.fg=ask self.robbed=yes
priority 1
say Robbed! Took the lot. | Somebody had my purse. I'll find them. | Not good. Thieves had my things.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=robbed 30m

rule x7_ga_grief_friend
when concept=greet.answer pair.mem.fg=ask self.mourning=friend
priority 2
say Not well. I lost a friend this week. | We buried a friend. I'm still... | Sad, #pet#. Just sad.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=grief 30m

rule x7_ga_grief_kin
when concept=greet.answer pair.mem.fg=ask self.mourning=kin
priority 3
say Not good. We buried them on Stoneday. | I keep setting a place at the table. | It's hard. It's very hard.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=grief 30m

rule x7_ga_widowed
when concept=greet.answer pair.mem.fg=ask self.widowed=yes
say Lonely, if I'm honest. | House is quiet these days. | Getting on. One day and then the next.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=lonely 30m

rule x7_ga_fought
when concept=greet.answer pair.mem.fg=ask self.fought=yes
say Had a scrap. You should see the other one. | Bit bruised. Won, though. Mostly. | Don't ask about my eye.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=fought 30m

rule x7_ga_spouse
when concept=greet.answer pair.mem.fg=ask self.spouse
say #self.spouse# has me painting the shutters. | Oh, #self.spouse# and I are well. Mostly. | #self.spouse# says hello. Probably.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=spouse 30m

rule x7_ga_child
when concept=greet.answer pair.mem.fg=ask self.child
say Worrying about #self.child#, as ever. | #self.child#'s well, so I'm well. | Ask #self.child#. They run the house now.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=child 30m

rule x7_ga_apprentice
when concept=greet.answer pair.mem.fg=ask self.apprentice=yes
say Master's working me to the bone. | Learning. Slowly. Painfully. | Swept the shop twice before dawn. Thanked for it? Never.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=work 30m

rule x7_ga_master
when concept=greet.answer pair.mem.fg=ask self.master=yes
say My apprentice ruined a day's work again. | Teaching. Gods give me patience. | The pup's coming along. Don't tell them I said so.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=work 30m

rule x7_ga_working
when concept=greet.answer pair.mem.fg=ask self.working=yes self.shift=during
say Run off my paws. Can't stop! | Working, working. Always working. | On the job. Walk with me.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=busy 30m

rule x7_ga_after
when concept=greet.answer pair.mem.fg=ask self.shift=after
say Done for the day, thank the gods. | Free! Free till morning. | Just finished. Every bone aches.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=free 30m

rule x7_ga_before
when concept=greet.answer pair.mem.fg=ask self.shift=before
say On my way to work. Don't remind me. | Off to it. Wish me luck. | Late, as usual.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=busy 30m

rule x7_ga_day_off
when concept=greet.answer pair.mem.fg=ask self.shift=day_off
say Day off! Doing nothing at all. | Resting. Officially. | Not working today. Isn't it lovely?
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=free 30m

rule x7_ga_travelling
when concept=greet.answer pair.mem.fg=ask self.travelling=yes
say Passing through. Every bone rattled. | On the road again. Never stop, me. | Road-weary, #pet#. Road-weary.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=road 30m

rule x7_ga_wedding
when concept=greet.answer pair.mem.fg=ask self.errand=wedding
priority 1
say Off to a wedding! Is my ruff straight? | Wedding! Can't stop! | Busy! There's a wedding!
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=wedding 30m

rule x7_ga_funeral
when concept=greet.answer pair.mem.fg=ask self.errand=funeral
priority 2
say Off to a burying. | Not good. It's the funeral today. | I'm going to the funeral.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=grief 30m

rule x7_ga_errand
when concept=greet.answer pair.mem.fg=ask self.errand=letter|goods|order|caravan
say Running about for other folk, as ever. | On an errand. Always an errand. | Can't stop, I've things to carry.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=busy 30m

rule x7_ga_merry
when concept=greet.answer pair.mem.fg=ask self.humour=merry
say Never better! Never worse, either. | Grand! Splendid! Middling! | Better now. You always make me laugh. I don't know why. It's your face.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=merry 30m

rule x7_ga_dry
when concept=greet.answer pair.mem.fg=ask self.humour=dry
say Alive. Mostly. | Oh, thriving. Can't you tell? | As well as can be expected, and I expect very little.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=merry 30m

rule x7_ga_quiet
when concept=greet.answer pair.mem.fg=ask self.talk=quiet
say Mm. Well. | Fine. | All right.

rule x7_ga_chatty
when concept=greet.answer pair.mem.fg=ask self.talk=chatty
say Oh, don't get me started! Well, all right, since you ask, the roof's leaking, my sister's coming, and the cat's had kittens. | Fine, fine! Busy! You'll never guess what I heard! | Well! Where to begin? The roof, the neighbours, or my back?
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=lots 30m

rule x7_ga_gruff
when concept=greet.answer pair.mem.fg=ask self.tone=gruff
say Fine. | Same as ever. | What's it to you? Ha. Fine.

rule x7_ga_formal
when concept=greet.answer pair.mem.fg=ask self.tone=formal
say Very well, thank you for asking. | Quite well, I thank you. | Well, thank you. Most kind.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=ok 30m

rule x7_ga_shy
when concept=greet.answer pair.mem.fg=ask self.tone=shy
say Oh! Um. Fine, thank you. | Oh, hello. Yes. Fine. | Me? Oh. All right, I think.

rule x7_ga_nervy
when concept=greet.answer pair.mem.fg=ask self.temper=nervy
say Oh! Gods, I didn't see you there. Fine, fine. | Jumpy. Didn't sleep. Fine otherwise. | Is something wrong? No? Oh, good. Fine.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=meh 30m

rule x7_ga_short
when concept=greet.answer pair.mem.fg=ask self.temper=short
say Don't ask. | Fine, before you ask again. | Who wants to know? Oh. You. Fine.

rule x7_ga_devout
when concept=greet.answer pair.mem.fg=ask self.piety=devout
say Blessed, #pet#. Truly. | Well, by the Bright One's grace. | The gods are good. Mostly.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=ok 30m

rule x7_ga_ambitious
when concept=greet.answer pair.mem.fg=ask self.drive=ambitious
say Busy. Going places. | Got plans, #pet#. Big ones. | Can't stop. Things to do, coin to make.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=busy 30m

rule x7_ga_restless
when concept=greet.answer pair.mem.fg=ask self.drive=restless
say Bored stiff. This town. | Same street, same faces. Not yours, I mean. | Itching to be off somewhere. Anywhere.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=meh 30m

rule x7_ga_old
when concept=greet.answer pair.mem.fg=ask self.stage=old
say Creaking. But here. | Another day above ground. | Old, #pet#. Old. But well.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=ok 30m

rule x7_ga_young
when concept=greet.answer pair.mem.fg=ask self.stage=young
priority 1
say I found a beetle! | I'm not allowed to talk to... oh, it's you. Hello! | Look, I lost a tooth!

rule x7_ga_adolescent
when concept=greet.answer pair.mem.fg=ask self.stage=adolescent
say Ugh. Fine. | Fine. Whatever. | Don't tell my mum you saw me.

rule x7_ga_summer
when concept=greet.answer pair.mem.fg=ask here.season=summer here.weather=clear
say Melting. | Too #hot# to talk. | Lovely weather. For lizards.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=ok 30m

rule x7_ga_sump
when concept=greet.answer pair.mem.fg=ask self.quarter=sump here.region=ridgemere
say Still alive in the Sump. That's something. | Surviving. Down there, that's winning. | Nobody's knifed me this week.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=poor 30m

rule x7_ga_heights
when concept=greet.answer pair.mem.fg=ask self.quarter=heights here.region=ridgemere
say Oh, splendid. The view, you know. | Very well. The Heights agree with me. | Tolerably well.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=good 30m

## The weather remarked on ("Wet enough for you?", "Cold enough for you?").

rule x7_ga_wet
when concept=greet.answer pair.mem.fg=wet
priority 1
say Damp. Like everyone. | Wet through. And you look worse. | Half drowned, thanks for asking. | I've stopped noticing. It's that or weep.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=ok 30m

rule x7_ga_wet_fisher
when concept=greet.answer pair.mem.fg=wet self.job=fisher|sailor
priority 1
say This? This is a mist, this is. | Wet's my trade. | Ha! I'm wetter at work.

rule x7_ga_cold
when concept=greet.answer pair.mem.fg=cold
priority 1
say Frozen to the marrow. | Can't feel my paws. Otherwise grand. | #cold.capitalize#. #cold.capitalize#, #cold#, #cold#.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=cold 30m

rule x7_ga_cold_frost
when concept=greet.answer pair.mem.fg=cold self.from=frosthollow
priority 1
say This? Call this cold? | Ha! Come up the Pass Road in Deepwinter, then talk to me. | It's a mild one. Mild!

## Seen to be tired, hurt, grieving or robbed: answering that.

rule x7_ga_seen_tired
when concept=greet.answer pair.mem.fg=tired
priority 3
