then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=thanked 30m

rule x7_ga_seen_robbed
when concept=greet.answer pair.mem.fg=robbed
priority 3
say Not a scratch, but they took the lot. | I'm all right. My purse isn't. | Nothing from the Watch. Nothing at all.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=robbed 30m

rule x7_ga_seen_widow
when concept=greet.answer pair.mem.fg=widow
priority 3
say I manage. Mostly. The evenings are long. | I talk to the walls. They're poor company. | Better for being asked, #pet#.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=lonely 30m

## Where they're off to (friend.where; self: the one asked)

rule x7_fw_any
when concept=friend.where
say Nowhere special. Walking. | Just stretching my legs. | Round and about. | Off to see a wolf about a thing.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=nowhere 30m

rule x7_fw_any2
when concept=friend.where
say Here, there, and back again. | Errands. Always errands. | Where am I not going, more like.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=errand 30m

rule x7_fw_work
when concept=friend.where self.shift=before|during
say Work. Where else? | To work, and I'm late. | The usual. The grind.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=working 30m

rule x7_fw_home
when concept=friend.where self.shift=after here.time=dusk|night
say Home. #supper.capitalize# and #bed#. | Home, if I can find it in the dark. | Home. Don't keep me, my feet are dying.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=home 30m

rule x7_fw_market
when concept=friend.where here.day=market here.time=dawn|day
say Market, like everyone. | The stalls, before the good stuff goes. | Market. I need eggs and a new pot.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=market 30m

rule x7_fw_chapel
when concept=friend.where here.day=rest self.piety=devout here.time=dawn|day
priority 1
