then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=chapel 30m

rule x7_fw_chapel_ordinary
when concept=friend.where here.day=rest self.piety=ordinary here.time=dawn|day
say Chapel. Probably. Eventually. | I told my mother I'd go to chapel. | Wherever the chapel isn't.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=chapel_maybe 30m

rule x7_fw_tavern
when concept=friend.where here.time=dusk|night self.stage=adult|old
say The tavern. Don't judge me. | Wherever there's #ale#. | One drink. Just one. You know.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=tavern 30m

rule x7_fw_festival
when concept=friend.where here.day=festival
say Where do you think? The fun! | Dancing! Come on! | Following the smell of roasting.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=festival 30m

rule x7_fw_letter
when concept=friend.where self.errand=letter
priority 1
say Letter to deliver. Very important, apparently. | Carrying a letter. Don't ask, I've not read it. | Somebody's got news coming. I'm the one bringing it.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=errand 30m

rule x7_fw_goods
when concept=friend.where self.errand=goods|order
priority 1
say Fetching an order. Heavy one. | Goods for the shop. | Picking up what somebody forgot.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=errand 30m

rule x7_fw_wedding
when concept=friend.where self.errand=wedding
priority 2
say A wedding! Can you tell? I've brushed my tail! | The wedding! I'm late! | To see two fools wed. Lovely.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=wedding 30m

rule x7_fw_funeral
when concept=friend.where self.errand=funeral
priority 2
say The burying. | To say goodbye. | Funeral. I'd rather not talk about it.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=grief 30m

rule x7_fw_healer
when concept=friend.where self.injured=light|bad
priority 1
say The healer's. Look at this. | To get this seen to. | Healer. Don't laugh.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=hurt 30m

rule x7_fw_food
when concept=friend.where self.hungry=yes
say Food. Anywhere with food. | To eat. I've been dreaming of pie. | #supper.capitalize#. Late #supper#.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=hungry 30m

rule x7_fw_road
when concept=friend.where self.travelling=yes
say On the road again. | Out of town for a bit. | Off along the road. Back in a few days.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=road 30m

rule x7_fw_young
when concept=friend.where self.stage=young
priority 1
say Nowhere! | It's a secret. | To find frogs. Want to come?

rule x7_fw_sly
when concept=friend.where self.honesty=sly
say Ah, that would be telling. | Here and there. Mostly there. | Off to make some coin. Don't ask how.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=nowhere 30m

rule x7_fw_short
when concept=friend.where self.temper=short
say Out. Why? | Somewhere you're not. Ha. | Does it matter?

## A tease, answered (friend.tease; self: the one teased; pair.mem.ft: what kind of tease)

rule x7_ft_any
when concept=friend.tease pair.mem.ft=looks
say Says you! Have you looked in a puddle lately? | Ha! Takes one to know one. | Rich, coming from you. | Coming from the expert.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=comeback 30m

rule x7_ft_any2
when concept=friend.tease pair.mem.ft=looks
say Oh, very funny. | Watch it, you. | Charming. Absolutely charming. | I'll remember that.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=tease 30m

rule x7_ft_any3
when concept=friend.tease pair.mem.ft=looks
say Go on, get it out of your system. | Ha! Fair. Fair. | You've been saving that one.

rule x7_ft_merry
when concept=friend.tease pair.mem.ft=looks self.humour=merry
say Ha! You're one to talk, you look like a wet hedge. | Jealous. You're jealous. I understand. | I'll take that as a compliment.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=comeback 30m

rule x7_ft_dry
when concept=friend.tease pair.mem.ft=looks self.humour=dry
say I'll have you know I spent all morning on this. | Thank you. I work very hard at it. | And you're the picture of elegance, as ever.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=comeback 30m

rule x7_ft_short
when concept=friend.tease pair.mem.ft=looks self.temper=short
say Watch your mouth. | Say that again. Go on. | Not today. I'm not in the mood.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=sore 30m

rule x7_ft_shy
when concept=friend.tease pair.mem.ft=looks self.tone=shy
say Oh. Um. Is it that bad? | Stop it! People are looking. | Oh no, really? Where?
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=shy 30m

rule x7_ft_young
when concept=friend.tease pair.mem.ft=looks self.stage=young|adolescent
priority 1
say Am not! | You're one to talk! | Says you! | Ha! Shut up!

rule x7_ft_owe
when concept=friend.tease pair.mem.ft=owe
say Restday. I'll pay you Restday. Which Restday, I couldn't say. | Put it on my slate. | Have I? I'd swear I paid. | You'll have it. You'll have it!
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=owe 30m

rule x7_ft_owe_poor
when concept=friend.tease pair.mem.ft=owe self.wealth=poor|destitute
say When I've got it, you'll have it. Don't hold your breath. | Gods, don't. I've not a penny this week. | Soon. Truly. I'm #skint#.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=owe 30m

rule x7_ft_owe_short
when concept=friend.tease pair.mem.ft=owe self.temper=short
say You'll get it! Stop asking! | Every time you see me. Every time. | Shout it a bit louder, the whole street didn't hear.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=sore 30m

rule x7_ft_pup
when concept=friend.tease pair.mem.ft=pup
say I'm nearly as tall as you now! | Only a little bit of trouble. | I'm not a pup!
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=pup 30m

rule x7_ft_neighbour
when concept=friend.tease pair.mem.ft=neigh
say Your lot are worse, and you know it. | I'll see to it when you see to your fence. | That wasn't us. That was the other neighbours.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=comeback 30m

rule x7_ft_neighbour_sorry
