say What's the occasion? | What are we celebrating? | Why, what's happened?
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=occasion 30m

rule x7_fi_tired
when concept=friend.invite self.tired=yes self.stage=adult|old
priority 1
say I'd fall asleep in my cup. Another night. | Gods, I'd love to, but I'm done in. | Only if there's a bed at the end of it.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=no 30m

rule x7_fi_working
when concept=friend.invite self.working=yes self.stage=adult|old
say After work. If there's an after. | Can't, I'm working. Save me a seat. | When I'm done here. Which is never.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=maybe 30m

rule x7_fi_spouse
when concept=friend.invite pair.mem.fi=plain|fest self.spouse
say I'll have to ask #self.spouse#. | #self.spouse#'ll want to come too. That all right? | If #self.spouse# lets me out.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=maybe 30m

rule x7_fi_chatty
when concept=friend.invite self.talk=chatty self.stage=adult|old
say Yes! Yes! I've so much to tell you! | Try and stop me! | Oh, yes. I've news that'll curl your tail.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=yes 30m

rule x7_fi_quiet
when concept=friend.invite pair.mem.fi=plain|fest self.talk=quiet
say Maybe. | If it's quiet. | We'll see.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=maybe 30m

rule x7_fi_poor
when concept=friend.invite pair.mem.fi=plain|fest self.wealth=poor|destitute
say If you're buying. I'm #skint#. | I've not a penny, mind. | I'd come, but I can't stand a round.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=skint 30m

rule x7_fi_hungry
when concept=friend.invite self.hungry=yes self.stage=adult|old
priority 1
say You'd do that? Gods. Thank you. | I'll not say no to a meal. | I'll be there. First through the door.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=fed 30m

rule x7_fi_feed_proud
when concept=friend.invite pair.mem.fi=feed self.wealth!=destitute self.temper=short|even self.warmth=cold|reserved
priority 1
say I'm not a charity case. | I'll manage. But... thank you. | I've food. Well. I'll have food.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=proud 30m

rule x7_fi_grief
when concept=friend.invite self.mourning=kin|friend
priority 2
say Not yet. Not yet. But thank you. | Maybe in a week or two. | I couldn't. I'm not fit company.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=grief 30m

rule x7_fi_young
when concept=friend.invite pair.mem.fi=play self.stage=young
priority 1
say Yes! | Can't, I'm in trouble. | Only if I get to choose!

rule x7_fi_young_asked
when concept=friend.invite pair.mem.fi=plain|fest|feed self.stage=young|adolescent
priority 1
say Can I? I'll have to ask my #mum#. | Will there be cake? | Yes please!

rule x7_fi_devout_rest
when concept=friend.invite pair.mem.fi=plain here.day=rest here.time=dawn|day self.piety=devout
priority 1
say After chapel. Not before. | On Restday? Well. After prayers. | Chapel first, then gladly.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=yes 30m

rule x7_fi_old
when concept=friend.invite pair.mem.fi=plain|fest self.stage=old
say Early, mind. I'm in bed by dark. | If I can sit near the fire. | Ha! I'll come. I'll not dance.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=yes 30m

## A piece of news, answered (friend.news; self: the one told; pair.mem.fq: what was raised)

rule x7_fn_any
when concept=friend.news
say Never! | You don't say. | Is that so? | Go on!
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=news 30m

rule x7_fn_gossip
when concept=friend.news pair.mem.fq=gossip
priority 2
say Who? Tell me! Don't you dare walk off! | You can't say that and leave! | You're cruel, you are. Cruel.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=gossip 30m

rule x7_fn_wedding
when concept=friend.news pair.mem.fq=wedding
priority 2
say I cried. Don't tell anyone. | Danced till my paws ached. | Missed it, more's the pity. I heard it was lovely.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=wed 30m

rule x7_fn_death
when concept=friend.news pair.mem.fq=death
priority 2
say I heard. Terrible. | Aye. I'll be at the burying. | Gods rest them.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=sad 30m

rule x7_fn_birth
when concept=friend.news pair.mem.fq=birth
priority 2
say I saw! Tiny little thing. All ears. | Another pup! Bless them. | Ha! Good luck to the parents, they'll not sleep for a year.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=pup_news 30m

rule x7_fn_bandits
when concept=friend.news pair.mem.fq=bandits
priority 2
say I heard. I'm not setting a paw on that road. | Let the Watch go looking. I'm staying in. | Gods. Anyone hurt?
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=worry 30m

rule x7_fn_bandits_carter
when concept=friend.news pair.mem.fq=bandits self.job=carter|merchant|sailor
priority 3
say I'm on that road Riverday. Don't. | That's my trade gone if it keeps on. | I'll go round by the hills. Twice as long, half as dead.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=worry 30m

rule x7_fn_crime
when concept=friend.news pair.mem.fq=crime
priority 2
say I heard. I've put a second bolt on. | Nobody's safe. Nobody. | The Watch'll have them. I hope.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=worry 30m

rule x7_fn_festival
when concept=friend.news pair.mem.fq=festival
priority 2
say Wouldn't miss it! | Course I'm going. I've been practising my dancing. | If I can get the day off.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=fest_soon 30m

rule x7_fn_prices
when concept=friend.news pair.mem.fq=prices
priority 2
say Robbery. Plain robbery. | I saw. I'll be going without, then. | Don't. Don't, I'll weep.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=dear 30m

rule x7_fn_prices_rich
when concept=friend.news pair.mem.fq=prices self.wealth=rich
priority 3
say Have they? I hadn't noticed. | Oh, is it dear? I suppose it would be. | Hm. The cook sees to that.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=rich 30m

rule x7_fn_prices_merchant
when concept=friend.news pair.mem.fq=prices self.role=merchant
priority 3
say Don't look at me. I pay more too. | It's the roads. Blame the roads. | You think I like it? I'm selling less.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=dear 30m

rule x7_fn_child
when concept=friend.news pair.mem.fq=child
priority 2
say Oh, the same. Never listens, never sits still. | Well, thank you. I'll tell them you asked. | A worry and a joy. Mostly a joy.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=child 30m

rule x7_fn_spouse
when concept=friend.news pair.mem.fq=spouse
priority 2
say Oh, nagging me about the roof. | Busy. We pass in the doorway. | Well, mostly. Don't ask about the roof.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=spouse 30m

rule x7_fn_shop_good
when concept=friend.news pair.mem.fq=shop self.business=thriving
priority 3
say Can't complain! Can't stop, either. | Run off my paws. Wouldn't change it. | Doing well, aye. Touch wood.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=good 30m

rule x7_fn_shop_bad
when concept=friend.news pair.mem.fq=shop self.business=failing
priority 3
say Honestly? I don't know how long we'll last. | Holding on. Just. | Don't. I lie awake over it.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=bad 30m

rule x7_fn_chapel
when concept=friend.news pair.mem.fq=chapel
priority 2
say I'll be there, I'll be there. | I've been meaning to. Truly. | Restday. I promise.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=chapel_promise 30m

rule x7_fn_order
when concept=friend.news pair.mem.fq=order
priority 2
say Tomorrow. First thing. | It's ready. Come by after noon. | Give me till Restday. Sorry!
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=order 30m

rule x7_fn_shop_visit
when concept=friend.news pair.mem.fq=shop_visit
priority 2
say I'll come by! I've been meaning to. | Have you? Oh, go on then. | No other shop, I swear. Just no coin.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=visit 30m

rule x7_fn_favour
when concept=friend.news pair.mem.fq=favour
priority 2
say Fine. I'll try and remember. | If there's any left. | You'll owe me. Again.
then other: friend.close
remember pair: fx=favour 30m

## The last word (friend.close; self: the first speaker again; pair.mem.fx: how the other answered)

rule x7_fc_any
when concept=friend.close
say Ha! Well, mind how you go. | Right. Good. Off I go. | Can't stand here all day. #later.capitalize#! | Look after yourself.

rule x7_fc_any2
when concept=friend.close
say I'll let you get on. | Right you are. | Go on then, #pet#.

rule x7_fc_ok
when concept=friend.close pair.mem.fx=ok
priority 2
say Good. That's good. | Glad to hear it. | Keep it that way. | That's all we can ask.

rule x7_fc_meh
when concept=friend.close pair.mem.fx=meh
priority 2
say Ah well. Could be worse. | Aren't we all, #pet#. | It'll pass, whatever it is. | Chin up. Spring always comes. Eventually.

rule x7_fc_lots
when concept=friend.close pair.mem.fx=lots
priority 2
say Gods, and I only asked. | You can tell me the rest on Restday. | Ha! Breathe, #pet#. Breathe.

rule x7_fc_spouse
when concept=friend.close pair.mem.fx=spouse
priority 2
say Ha! That's marriage, #pet#. | Give them my best all the same. | Sounds about right.

rule x7_fc_tired
when concept=friend.close pair.mem.fx=tired
priority 2
say Get some sleep, #pet#. | Go home and put your feet up. | Bed. Now. I mean it.

rule x7_fc_hungry
when concept=friend.close pair.mem.fx=hungry
priority 2
say Come by later, there's broth on. | Here, I've half a loaf. Take it. | Go eat something before you fall over.

rule x7_fc_hungry_poor
when concept=friend.close pair.mem.fx=hungry self.wealth=poor|destitute
priority 3
say Me too. Me too. | Join the club. | If I had a crust I'd split it with you.

rule x7_fc_poor
when concept=friend.close pair.mem.fx=poor
priority 2
say If it gets bad, you come to me. | It'll turn. It always turns. | Chin up. Something'll come along.

rule x7_fc_poor_rich
when concept=friend.close pair.mem.fx=poor self.wealth=rich
priority 3
say Here. No, take it. Don't argue. | Come and see me. I'll find you some work. | You should have said. You should always say.

rule x7_fc_good
when concept=friend.close pair.mem.fx=good
priority 2
say Well, look at you! | Don't forget us little folk. | Good for you. Truly.

rule x7_fc_good_poor
when concept=friend.close pair.mem.fx=good self.wealth=poor|destitute
priority 3
say Must be nice. | Lend us a penny, then. | Some of us, eh?

rule x7_fc_bad
when concept=friend.close pair.mem.fx=bad
priority 2
say It'll pick up. | Chin up. Market day's coming. | I'll send folk your way. Promise.

rule x7_fc_hurt
when concept=friend.close pair.mem.fx=hurt
priority 2
say See a healer, you daft thing. | Keep off it a few days. | Who was it? Just tell me who.

rule x7_fc_grief
when concept=friend.close pair.mem.fx=grief
priority 2
say Anything you need. Anything. | I'm so sorry, #pet#. | I'll bring something round. Don't argue.

rule x7_fc_grief_devout
when concept=friend.close pair.mem.fx=grief|thanked self.piety=devout
priority 3
say The Bright One keeps them now. | I'll light a candle tonight. | #bless.capitalize#, #pet#.

rule x7_fc_thanked
when concept=friend.close pair.mem.fx=thanked
priority 2
say Come by any time. Any time at all. | Lean on me. That's what I'm for. | You know where I am.

rule x7_fc_lonely
when concept=friend.close pair.mem.fx=lonely
priority 2
say Come for #supper#. Restday. I mean it. | You've always a seat at mine. | Don't sit in alone. Come and find me.

rule x7_fc_sad
when concept=friend.close pair.mem.fx=sad
priority 2
say Aye. Gods rest them. | Hard times. | We'll all be there.

rule x7_fc_robbed
when concept=friend.close pair.mem.fx=robbed
priority 2
say Scum. I'll keep an ear out. | Thieves. Hanging's too good. | If you need anything to tide you over, say.

rule x7_fc_fought
when concept=friend.close pair.mem.fx=fought
priority 2
say Ha! You never could keep out of trouble. | Next time, walk away. Or win properly. | Put something cold on that eye.

rule x7_fc_child
when concept=friend.close pair.mem.fx=child
priority 2
say That's the job, #pet#. It never stops. | Give them my love. | Ha! They're worth it. Mostly.

rule x7_fc_work
when concept=friend.close pair.mem.fx=work
priority 2
say Ha! We all started somewhere. | It gets easier. Well, it doesn't, but you get used to it. | Patience. That's the trade.

rule x7_fc_busy
when concept=friend.close pair.mem.fx=busy
priority 2
say Go on then, don't let me keep you. | Off you go! | Don't work too hard.

rule x7_fc_free
when concept=friend.close pair.mem.fx=free
priority 2
say Lucky you! | Enjoy it. You've earned it. | Some of us still have work.

rule x7_fc_road
when concept=friend.close pair.mem.fx=road
priority 2
say Safe roads, then. | Tell me all about it next time. | Mind yourself out there.

rule x7_fc_wedding
when concept=friend.close pair.mem.fx=wedding
priority 2
say You look grand. Go on! | Dance once for me. | Bring me back some cake!

rule x7_fc_wed
when concept=friend.close pair.mem.fx=wed
priority 2
say Best day this town's had in a month. | Ha! There'll be pups by next spring, mark me. | They'll be happy, those two. You can always tell.

rule x7_fc_pup_news
when concept=friend.close pair.mem.fx=pup_news
priority 2
say Bless the little thing. | The grandparents'll be unbearable now. | One more for the Commons School, eh?

rule x7_fc_merry
when concept=friend.close pair.mem.fx=merry
priority 2
say Ha! You never change. | Fool. I love you. Go away. | Ha! Get on with you.

rule x7_fc_cold
when concept=friend.close pair.mem.fx=cold
priority 2
say Get yourself by a fire. | Keep moving. Keep moving! | Spring, #pet#. It'll come.

rule x7_fc_nowhere
when concept=friend.close pair.mem.fx=nowhere|errand
priority 2
say Fair enough. | Mind how you go, then. | Well, don't get lost.

rule x7_fc_work_where
when concept=friend.close pair.mem.fx=working
priority 2
say Better you than me. | Go on, earn your crust. | See you at the end of it.

rule x7_fc_home
when concept=friend.close pair.mem.fx=home
priority 2
say Sleep well. | Rest those feet. | Off with you, then. #later.capitalize#.

rule x7_fc_market
when concept=friend.close pair.mem.fx=market
priority 2
say Don't let them rob you. | Bring me back a pie, there's a dear. | Mind your purse in the crush.

rule x7_fc_chapel
when concept=friend.close pair.mem.fx=chapel
priority 2
say Say a prayer for me. | Light one for my mother, will you? | I'll be along. Maybe.

rule x7_fc_chapel_maybe
when concept=friend.close pair.mem.fx=chapel_maybe
priority 2
say Ha! Your secret's safe with me. | The Bright One sees you, mind. | I'll not tell your mother.

rule x7_fc_tavern
when concept=friend.close pair.mem.fx=tavern
priority 2
say Don't drink it all. Save me one. | One, you said. I'll be counting. | Ha! I'll be along.

rule x7_fc_festival
when concept=friend.close pair.mem.fx=festival
priority 2
say Save me a dance! | Ha! Wait for me! | Don't eat all the cakes!

rule x7_fc_fest_soon
when concept=friend.close pair.mem.fx=fest_soon
priority 2
say Good. It's no fun without you. | I'll hold you to that. | Bring your dancing paws.

rule x7_fc_comeback
when concept=friend.close pair.mem.fx=comeback
priority 2
say Ha! Fair. | Got me there. | You'll keep. | Ha! I walked into that.
