then other: friend.parting
remember pair: fp=light 30m

rule x7_fc_sore
when concept=friend.close pair.mem.fx=sore
priority 2
say All right, all right. Only teasing. | Someone's in a mood. | Sorry. Sorry! Gods.

rule x7_fc_shy
when concept=friend.close pair.mem.fx=shy
priority 2
say I'm only teasing! You look fine. | No, no, you look lovely. Honest. | Ha! Don't fret, #pet#.

rule x7_fc_owe
when concept=friend.close pair.mem.fx=owe
priority 2
say Ha! I'll hold you to it. | I've a long memory, #pet#. | I'll be counting, mind.

rule x7_fc_pup
when concept=friend.close pair.mem.fx=pup
priority 2
say Ha! Mind you grow into those ears. | That's the spirit. Off you go. | Ha! Say hello to your #mum# for me.

rule x7_fc_sorry
when concept=friend.close pair.mem.fx=sorry
priority 2
say Ah, no harm done. | Never mind. It's only a bit of #mud#. | Ha! I'd only mention it to you.

rule x7_fc_yes
when concept=friend.close pair.mem.fx=yes
priority 2
