then other: friend.parting
remember pair: fp=light 30m

rule x7_fc_fed
when concept=friend.close pair.mem.fx=fed
priority 2
say Good. Come hungry. | Dusk, then. There'll be plenty. | Don't thank me. Just eat.

rule x7_fc_proud
when concept=friend.close pair.mem.fx=proud
priority 2
say Nobody said charity. I said supper. | Suit yourself. The door's open. | Then come for the company. The food's just there.

rule x7_fc_skint
when concept=friend.close pair.mem.fx=skint
priority 2
