rule x7_fc_worry
when concept=friend.close pair.mem.fx=worry
priority 2
say Mind yourself, that's all. | Strange times. | Stay in after dark, the pair of us.

rule x7_fc_dear
when concept=friend.close pair.mem.fx=dear
priority 2
say Aye, well. Somebody's getting fat on it. | It'll come down. They always say it will. | Bread and water, the pair of us.

rule x7_fc_rich
when concept=friend.close pair.mem.fx=rich
priority 2
say Of course you hadn't. | Must be lovely, being you. | Ha! Course not.

rule x7_fc_chapel_promise
when concept=friend.close pair.mem.fx=chapel_promise
priority 2
